{"suttaId":"tha-ap493","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2524,2547],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap493:0.3":"Tikiṅkaṇipupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap493:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jotantaṃ, nisinnaṃ pabbatantare;","tha-ap493:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, vipassiṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap493:2.1":"“Tīṇi kiṅkaṇipupphāni, paggayha abhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap493:2.3":"Sambuddhamabhipūjetvā, gacchāmi dakkhiṇāmukho.","tha-ap493:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap493:3.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap493:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap493:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap493:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap493:5.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap493:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap493:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap493:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap493:7.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap493:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tikiṅkaṇipupphiyo thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap493:9.1":"Tikiṅkaṇipupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
